OL,3,GNEWSACharity backs call for resting
OL,4,Aseal protection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is backing a campaign calling
OL,7,Ffor stronger legal protection for
OL,8,Fseals, saying human disturbance is
OL,9,Fharming their health and welfare.
OL,11,FThe Seal Research Trust, based in
OL,12,FCornwall, has backed calls from the UK
OL,13,FSeal Alliance to make the deliberate
OL,14,Fdisturbance of seals an offence under
OL,15,Fthe Wildlife and Countryside Act.
OL,17,FTrust founder Sue Sayers said seals
OL,18,Fresting on beaches were regularly being
OL,19,Fdisturbed by people, causing stress,
OL,20,Finjury and sleep deprivation.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
