OL,3,GNEWSACharity backs call for resting
OL,4,Aseal protection
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,7,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said: "We
OL,8,Fhave a suite of legislative protections
OL,9,Fin place which make it an offence to
OL,10,Ftake, injure, capture or kill a seal."
